# Research-to-Decision (IdeaTub)

When the user wants to run the **Research-to-Decision** workflow, **operator / investor diligence**, or points at `docs/research-to-decision/`:

1. Read **`resources/prompts/research-to-decision-ideatub.md`** for IdeaTub MCP fields and paths.
2. Load **`resources/skills/research-to-decision/<step>/SKILL.md`** (bundled; prefilled IdeaTub URLs) or upstream OB1 **`SKILL.md`** for parity ([recipe index](https://github.com/NateBJones-Projects/OB1/tree/main/recipes/research-to-decision-workflow)); skills define behavior, not this rule.
3. Use **`search_thoughts`** / **`browse_recent`** when priming context; **`capture_plan`** / **`capture_thought`** for durable outputs per `CLAUDE.md`.

Design reference: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-30-research-to-decision-ideatub-design.md`.

Upstream recipe: [OB1 — research-to-decision-workflow](https://github.com/NateBJones-Projects/OB1/tree/main/recipes/research-to-decision-workflow).
